# CLAUDE.md Template — WebDesk Growth Dashboard

> Extends `_spine/shared-knowledge/claude-md-template.md` (the base skill's canonical template — read it for the general rules this template doesn't repeat). Copy this version to the project root as `CLAUDE.md` for this specific project; it pre-fills the profile-specific values so nobody re-derives them each session.
>
> **This file IS the routing mechanism, not documentation of one.** The base orchestrator has no code that reads `project.project_profile` and auto-loads a matching profile — that field and that behavior don't exist in the base skill. The only reason `nodejs/projects/custom-app-build/profiles/webdesk-growth-dashboard/SKILL.md` loads for this project is that the line below, under "Required skill files," names it explicitly, positioned after the base `custom-app-build` skill and before any integration module. If that line is ever removed or the file is ever copied without it, the profile stops loading silently — nothing in the base orchestrator would detect or flag the omission. Corrected 2026-08-05 after external review; see `SKILL.md` §2's matching honesty note and `tests/routing-validation.md` for how this is checked.

